    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥδυσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>relish, seasoning, sauce</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				678
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
